<title>POLAND: BPH Q3 net rises to PLN 64.5 mln.</title>
<headline>BPH Q3 net rises to PLN 64.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>BPH SA results for the third quarter ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>					    Q3 1996	Q3 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit		   116.10    vs  84.59</p>
<p>    net				     64.54    vs  51.07</p>
<p>    pre-tax				116.10    vs  84.58</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is Bank Przemyslowo - Handlowy SA.</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	   0.00    vs   0.00</p>
